# =============================================================================
# Secrets & machine-specific values. Copy to .env and fill in.  NEVER commit .env
# =============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT: This bot is PAPER TRADING ONLY. It does NOT need — and must never be
# given — a private key, mnemonic, or any wallet-signing credential. There is no
# config option that accepts one.
#
# All the Polymarket endpoints we use for reading market & trade data are PUBLIC
# (no API key required). The only optional secret is a private Polygon RPC URL,
# used for on-chain trader tracking if you want higher rate limits than the
# public RPC. Everything works without it (falls back to the public RPC / Data API).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: your own Polygon (chain 137) JSON-RPC endpoint for on-chain trade
# log scanning. Leave blank to use the public default in config.yaml.
# Examples:
#   POLYGON_RPC_URL=https://polygon-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
#   POLYGON_RPC_URL=https://polygon-rpc.com
POLYGON_RPC_URL=

# Optional: override the SQLite DB path (otherwise config.yaml storage.db_path).
# DB_PATH=data/paper_trading.db
